[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_EMPIRE]
Friendship with Empire

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_EMPIRE_desc]
Despite the Empire’s bad reputation, we can still choose to befriend the victor of the Ultimate Battle. Such friendship will bring us great benefits - yes, purely out of interest.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_EMPIRE]
与帝国的友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_EMPIRE_desc]
虽说帝国的名声不佳，但我们仍然可以选择与终末之战的胜者结交。这样的友谊将会为我们带来巨大的好处 —— 是的，仅仅是出于利益。

